  "reason": "Existing evidence shows scvi_n200 encoder outperforms pca_n2000 in multiprofile RNA-only models (config_005: 0.6501 vs config_002: 0.5907). This experiment tests scvi_n200 in singleprofile setting (config_004) to isolate whether encoder improvements translate to singleprofile performance. Comparing to config_001 (pca_n2000 singleprofile) will clarify if the encoder's benefit is profile-agnostic, while avoiding aggregation changes that could confound results. This addresses key uncertainty about encoder impact versus profile settings with minimal design changes."
